            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-text">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            For the purposes of the table above, <span class="font-bold">"Net Revenue"</span> shall mean the amount of stakes placed by Players in the relevant calendar month exclude <span>(i)</span> returned winnings; <span>(ii)</span> any bonuses paid; <span>(iii)</span> Chargebacks; and <span>(iv)</span> any other revenue returns, credits, compensations or refunds given to Players.
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

